{"unit_id": "tag:02IM:statement", "translation": "诺特（Noetherian）雅各布森（Jacobson）概形（schemes）的例子。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0001>是诺特局部环（Noetherian local ring），则去心谱（punctured spectrum）<MATH_0002>是雅各布森（Jacobson）概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0003>是雅各布森根（Jacobson radical）为<MATH_0004>的诺特环（Noetherian ring），则<MATH_0005>是雅各布森（Jacobson）概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0006>是扎里斯基对（Zariski pair）（《代数（Algebra）续论》，定义<REF_0001>），且<MATH_0007>是诺特的（Noetherian），则<MATH_0008>是雅各布森（Jacobson）概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian local ring", "target_term": "诺特局部环"}, {"source_term": "punctured spectrum", "target_term": "去心谱"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson radical", "target_term": "雅各布森根"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Zariski pair", "target_term": "扎里斯基对"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特的"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "标题中限定概形的诺特性质。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "标题中限定概形的雅各布森性质。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "标题所列例子的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian local ring", "target_term": "诺特局部环", "context": "第一项的环假设。"}, {"source_term": "punctured spectrum", "target_term": "去心谱", "context": "第一项结论所涉及的谱。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "第一项结论中去心谱具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项结论中的对象